 "page": "MANT-6B",
 "note": "Typed as other by its code; the PDF page continues MANT-2, MANT-4 and MANT-5 for the other half of relapsed/refractory or progressive mantle cell lymphoma (progression on cBTKi or early relapse (<24 months) after a cBTKi-containing regimen: second-line non-covalent BTKi or other continuous regimens, or CAR T-cell therapy / fixed-duration regimens / ISRT; response, consolidation/additional therapy, follow-up, relapse #2 or greater). MANT-6A is the companion page for cBTKi-naive or late relapse. Boxes, arrows and conditions written from the PDF page image and text. Option lists printed in one bracket are one box. The entry has no condition of its own: 'early relapse (<24 months) after cBTKi' needs time since a BTK inhibitor, and months_to_relapse is measured from first-line therapy.",
